            "review_title": "Review at Ganh Dau - Galaxy Nguyen Van Qua",
            "review_text": "Tominer\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam22 contributions\n1\nAmazing food\nApr 2019\nWe ate in Gánh Đậu together in 4/2019, this is one of the most amazing experiences in my life. Food is so special for me to want to come back and eat again. \"Bún đậu\" and \" mắm tôm\" is the best combined ever, you must try it. I used to be scared by \"mắm tôm\", but it is delicious enough to taste once.\nWritten December 13, 2019",
